PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Intro::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Hey, {PLAYER}!\p"
    .string "Honestly? I was hoping it'd be\n"
    .string "you standing on the other side\l"
    .string "of that door.\p"
    .string "A CHAMPION needs a rival worth\n"
    .string "the name, after all. Keeps me\l"
    .string "sharp.\p"
    .string "You know I've been at this,\n"
    .string "right? Combing every corner for\l"
    .string "my POKéDEX.\p"
    .string "Building teams that could stand\n"
    .string "up to anything, any type, any\l"
    .string "matchup.\p"
    .string "And now, here I am…\p"
    .string "POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMPION!\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}, you get what that\n"
    .string "means, right?\p"
    .string "I'll spell it out for you anyway.\p"
    .string "I'm the strongest TRAINER in\n"
    .string "this whole world!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Hey, {PLAYER}!\p"
    .string "Look who's back for more!\n"
    .string "Ha, I like that.\p"
    .string "A CHAMPION needs a rival worth\n"
    .string "the name, after all. Keeps me\l"
    .string "sharp.\p"
    .string "You know I've been at this,\n"
    .string "right? Combing every corner for\l"
    .string "my POKéDEX.\p"
    .string "Building teams that could stand\n"
    .string "up to anything, any type, any\l"
