    .string "And now, here I am…\p"
    .string "POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMPION!\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}, you get what that\n"
    .string "means, right?\p"
    .string "I'll spell it out for you anyway.\p"
    .string "I'm the strongest TRAINER in\n"
    .string "this whole world!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Defeat::
    .string "No…\n"
    .string "No, that's not possible!\l"
    .string "That was everything I had!\p"
    .string "All that work, all that training,\n"
    .string "just to lose the title this fast?\p"
    .string "It's not fair. It's just not\n"
    .string "fair!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_Victory::
    .string "はーはッ！\n"
    .string "かった！　かった！　かった！\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}に　まける　ような\n"
    .string "おれさま　では　なーい！\p"
    .string "ま！　ポケモンの\n"
    .string "てんさい　{RIVAL}さま　あいてに\l"
    .string "ここまで　よく　がんばった！\p"
    .string "ほめて　つかわす！\n"
    .string "はーッ！　はーはッはッ！$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Why…\n"
    .string "Why did I lose?\p"
    .string "I didn't make a single mistake\n"
    .string "raising my POKéMON. Not one.\p"
    .string "…Darn it. Fine. You're the new\n"
    .string "POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMPION.\p"
    .string "Doesn't mean I have to like\n"
    .string "admitting it…$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakPlayer::
    .string "OAK: {PLAYER}!$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakCongratulations::
    .string "OAK: So, you've done it!\n"
    .string "Truly, congratulations, {PLAYER}!\p"
    .string "You're the new POKéMON LEAGUE\n"
    .string "CHAMPION!\p"
    .string "Look at you. It feels like only\n"
    .string "yesterday you left this town with\l"
    .string "{STR_VAR_1}, POKéDEX in hand.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}… you've well and truly\n"
    .string "come into your own.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakImDisappointedRival::
    .string "OAK: {RIVAL}…\p"
    .string "I won't pretend I'm not\n"
    .string "disappointed.\p"
    .string "I came the moment I heard you'd\n"
    .string "beaten the ELITE FOUR.\p"
    .string "And I arrive to find you'd\n"
    .string "already lost the title.\p"
    .string "{RIVAL}, do you understand why?\p"
    .string "Somewhere along the way, you\n"
    .string "stopped treating your POKéMON\l"
    .string "with love and trust.\p"
    .string "Skill alone won't carry you back\n"
    .string "to the top. Not without that.$"

PokemonLeague_ChampionsRoom_Text_OakPlayerComeWithMe::
    .string "OAK: {PLAYER}.\p"
    .string "You already understand, I think,\n"
    .string "that this victory was never\l"
    .string "yours alone.\p"
    .string "That bond between you and your\n"
    .string "POKéMON, it's a remarkable thing\l"
    .string "to see.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}, come with me, won't\n"
    .string "you?$"

